  "question": {
    "text": "A thin glass rod is bent in a semicircle of radius \\(\\mathrm{R}\\). A change is non-uniformly distributed along the rod with a linear charge density \\(\\lambda=\\lambda_0 \\sin \\left(\\lambda_0\\right.\\) is a positive constant). The electric field at the centre \\(P\\) of the semicircle is,\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/MlujJvxjH1OFoYR8t5A2VtxMwvmiiR9c3E_ulA7lWvA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "V0988",
      "text": "\\(-\\frac{\\lambda_0}{8 \\pi \\varepsilon_0 R} \\hat{j}\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tNwLV",
      "text": "\\(\\frac{\\lambda_0}{8 \\pi \\varepsilon_0 R} \\hat{j}\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "7JZhY",
      "text": "\\(\\frac{\\lambda_0}{8 \\pi \\varepsilon_0 R} \\hat{i}\\)",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "banhQ",
      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/DgZwWf0j3UB8KTHg9XlUFIne3KWNXepqPnRwa0b1C2s.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\lambda=\\lambda_0 \\sin \\theta \\\\\n& \\mathrm{dE}_{\\mathrm{y}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{k} \\lambda}{\\mathrm{R}} \\sin \\theta \\mathrm{d} \\theta \\\\\n& =\\frac{\\mathrm{k} \\lambda_0}{\\mathrm{R}} \\int_{-\\pi / 2}^{+\\pi / 2} \\sin ^2 \\theta \\mathrm{d} \\theta=\\frac{\\mathrm{k} \\lambda_0}{2 \\mathrm{R}} \\int_{-\\pi / 2}^{+\\pi / 2}(1-\\cos 2 \\theta) \\mathrm{d} \\theta \\\\\n& \\therefore \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{E}}=-\\frac{\\lambda_0}{8 \\varepsilon_0 \\mathrm{R}} \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
